Lina P.: Action items listed: 1) docs mapping table (Lina) 2) JS SDK typed errors + tests (Raj) 3) quickstart sample app catch/use human_message (Jordan) 4) telemetry fields added (TBD). Let's sync in next standup.

Jordan M.: Thanks everyone. Keeping this thread as the single source for owners. Cheers.
